<title>UK: Lloyds TSB raises UK base rate to 6.75.</title>
<headline>Lloyds TSB raises UK base rate to 6.75.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lloyds TSB Group Plc said it is raising its base lending rate 0.25 point to 6.75 per cent, effective from close of business on Thursday.</p>
<p>The move followed a similar increase by the Bank of England in its money market dealing rates.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864</p>
